  "apa": "Arya, S. S., Dias, S. B., Jelinek, H. F., Hadjileontiadis, L. J., & Pappa, A.-M. (2023). The convergence of traditional and digital biomarkers through AI-assisted biosensing: A new era in translational diagnostics? *Biosensors and Bioelectronics*, *235*, Article 115387. https://doi.org/10.1016/j.bios.2023.115387",
  "doi": "10.1016/j.bios.2023.115387",
